WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.777
Real data is messy. Clean it first, and your answers will be right.

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:09.372
Choose one spelling for each name, and use it everywhere.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:12.025
Remove records that were entered twice.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:19.029
Convert prices to one currency, L R D or U S D, and note the exchange rate.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:23.833
Sort each column to spot numbers that are far too big or too small.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:29.028
Always keep the raw data untouched, clean a copy, and write down what you changed.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:39.981
Before you move on, check: Fix inconsistent spellings. Remove duplicate rows. Convert all money to one currency. Keep the raw data untouched.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:43.764
In the next lesson: Summaries and formulas.
